    "furuya": "古谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Empty-handed and out of time, Muranishi is hung upside down in a freezing room where Furuya calmly recalls the cold winter day they first met and offers him one final cigarette.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "夏と冬、どっちが好きだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "寒いのは慣れてるよな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "俺たちが会った日も寒かった、そうだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "夢に出てきたんだよ、お前と会った日のことが。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "あの時俺どんな服着てたか覚えてるか？それだけ気になってな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "最後に吸うか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "じゃあ俺が吸おう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "けどまあ、バラせばどうにかなる。ノコは？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい捕まえろ！降りる！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "どけよ！村西、おい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい村西！お前逃げられると思ってるのか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい急げ、逃がすな！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "夏と冬、どっちが好きだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Summer or winter—which do you prefer?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "寒いのは慣れてるよな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're used to the cold, aren't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "俺たちが会った日も寒かった、そうだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The day we first met was cold too, wasn't it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "夢に出てきたんだよ、お前と会った日のことが。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It came to me in a dream—the day I met you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "あの時俺どんな服着てたか覚えてるか？それだけ気になってな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you remember what clothes I was wearing back then? That one detail has been nagging at me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "最後に吸うか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Want one final smoke?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "じゃあ俺が吸おう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I'll smoke it myself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "けどまあ、バラせばどうにかなる。ノコは？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, if we chop him up we'll manage. Where's the saw?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい捕まえろ！降りる！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, grab him! He's getting down!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "どけよ！村西、おい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Out of the way! Muranishi, stop!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい村西！お前逃げられると思ってるのか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, Muranishi! Do you really think you can run away from us?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい急げ、逃がすな！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry up—don't let him get away!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
